[[Open This|1. Creating a project]]

---

https://docs.oxide.computer/guides/quickstart#_creating_a_project

The first thing you’ll see after logging in is the Projects page. A project is a collection of resources like instances, disks, images, VPCs, and floating IPs. Instances must be created within a project. Create one by clicking New project.

Give your project a name and click Create project in the lower right corner. You’ll be taken into your project and shown the Instances page. There won’t be any instances yet.

